  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram below shows four energy levels for the atoms of a gas. The diagram is drawn to scale. The wavelengths of the photons emitted by the energy transitions between levels are shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What are the wavelengths of spectral lines, emitted by the gas, in order of decreasing frequency?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{3}, \\lambda_{2}, \\lambda_{1}, \\lambda_{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{4}, \\lambda_{1}, \\lambda_{2}, \\lambda_{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{4}, \\lambda_{3}, \\lambda_{2}, \\lambda_{1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{4}, \\lambda_{2}, \\lambda_{1}, \\lambda_{3}\"></span></li></ol>"
